fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth265parser.html#GstH265SubLayerHRDParams","fragment":"\n\tGstH265SubLayerHRDParams\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H265SubLayerHRDParams\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H265SubLayerHRDParams\n\nMembers\nDefines the Sublayer HRD parameters\ntogether with bit_rate_scale, it specifies\nthe maximum input bitrate when the CPB operates at the access\nunit level\nis used together with cpb_size_scale to\nspecify the CPB size when the CPB operates at the access unit\nlevel\nis used together with cpb_size_du_scale\nto specify the CPB size when the CPB operates at sub-picture\nlevel\ntogether with bit_rate_scale, it\nspecifies the maximum input bit rate when the CPB operates at the\nsub-picture level\nindicate whether HSS operates in intermittent bit rate\nmode or constant bit rate mode.\nDefines the Sublayer HRD parameters\ntogether with bit_rate_scale, it specifies\nthe maximum input bitrate when the CPB operates at the access\nunit level\nis used together with cpb_size_scale to\nspecify the CPB size when the CPB operates at the access unit\nlevel\nis used together with cpb_size_du_scale\nto specify the CPB size when the CPB operates at sub-picture\nlevel\ntogether with bit_rate_scale, it\nspecifies the maximum input bit rate when the CPB operates at the\nsub-picture level\nindicate whether HSS operates in intermittent bit rate\nmode or constant bit rate mode.\nDefines the Sublayer HRD parameters\ntogether with bit_rate_scale, it specifies\nthe maximum input bitrate when the CPB operates at the access\nunit level\nis used together with cpb_size_scale to\nspecify the CPB size when the CPB operates at the access unit\nlevel\nis used together with cpb_size_du_scale\nto specify the CPB size when the CPB operates at sub-picture\nlevel\ntogether with bit_rate_scale, it\nspecifies the maximum input bit rate when the CPB operates at the\nsub-picture level\nindicate whether HSS operates in intermittent bit rate\nmode or constant bit rate mode.\n"});